    "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slides </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny hats </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A public pool in the Duck-Town Square where you can showcase how cool your duck looks in its new flamboyant Victorian cloak!</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slowly Sliding Ducks is an online party game for 8-16 players. Compete against friends, foes, or AI in a delightfully absurd <strong>array of minigames</strong>: race to the finish line, be the last duck standing, or aim to come in last in a race where you just sit back and watch (<i>just like in a race of marbles</i>). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And once you're done competing, unlock new outfits and flaunt your latest acquisitions in the 50-player community pool!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mess With Your Friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485410/extras/178ffbbb1e869567859d3b205b9e8ca4.poster.avif?t=1746806237\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485410/extras/178ffbbb1e869567859d3b205b9e8ca4.webm?t=1746806237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485410/extras/178ffbbb1e869567859d3b205b9e8ca4.mp4?t=1746806237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Or Team Up Against Randoms</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485410/extras/b788761925845ef8382a7372138d88c0.poster.avif?t=1746806237\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485410/extras/b788761925845ef8382a7372138d88c0.webm?t=1746806237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485410/extras/b788761925845ef8382a7372138d88c0.mp4?t=1746806237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Or Score More Than Anyone!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485410/extras/28660d8b240c70c208b1d15a0b2e0109.poster.avif?t=1746806237\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485410/extras/28660d8b240c70c208b1d15a0b2e0109.webm?t=1746806237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485410/extras/28660d8b240c70c208b1d15a0b2e0109.mp4?t=1746806237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And Show Off Your Style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485410/extras/f1fcce14939976950c883c9965315fe6.poster.avif?t=1746806237\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485410/extras/f1fcce14939976950c883c9965315fe6.webm?t=1746806237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485410/extras/f1fcce14939976950c883c9965315fe6.mp4?t=1746806237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TURBOLENTO NOTES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slowly Sliding Ducks contains in-game items that can be purchased with real money. About this, we want to make things clear: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All cosmetics can be unlocked through gameplay. No item is exclusively obtainable through monetary purchase.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Microtransactions are strictly cosmetic and do not provide any gameplay advantage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your purchases fund our development updates and new games, and we sincerely appreciate every vote of confidence you give us with your purchases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We love hearing from our players, so please get in touch with any feedback, positive or negative.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slowly Sliding Ducks is an online party game for 8-16 players. Compete against friends, foes, or AI in a delightfully absurd <strong>array of minigames</strong>: race to the finish line, be the last duck standing, or aim to come in last in a race where you just sit back and watch (<i>just like in a race of marbles</i>). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And once you're done competing, unlock new outfits and flaunt your latest acquisitions in the 50-player community pool!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mess With Your Friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485410/extras/178ffbbb1e869567859d3b205b9e8ca4.poster.avif?t=1746806237\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485410/extras/178ffbbb1e869567859d3b205b9e8ca4.webm?t=1746806237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485410/extras/178ffbbb1e869567859d3b205b9e8ca4.mp4?t=1746806237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Or Team Up Against Randoms</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485410/extras/b788761925845ef8382a7372138d88c0.poster.avif?t=1746806237\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485410/extras/b788761925845ef8382a7372138d88c0.webm?t=1746806237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485410/extras/b788761925845ef8382a7372138d88c0.mp4?t=1746806237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\