vide any gameplay advantage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your purchases fund our development updates and new games, and we sincerely appreciate every vote of confidence you give us with your purchases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We love hearing from our players, so please get in touch with any feedback, positive or negative.\u00a0</p>",
